{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 607,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:665ebda0021e07d7a976d1cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每次放这首歌，背上的喵先生\\n都心情超好！招财猫果然也\\n喜欢鱼呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "52b9c2368d1d13913957a683f9a50d14aad0de2278f00ab067b819269f13a4f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "360"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93e0e9c2765dfe606fc7f151",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "向着顶点进发～♪\\n“以巅峰为目标”……\\n真是太适合我的歌词了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60100e8c83648fff3996b1c2f032fcac8f0743aee376da2d986500e8f6026ec2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "361"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b876f804a2dbfef36f2aa2de",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个……听说是音头我还以为\\n是慢节奏……一般人都会这么想吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce05037a76dab41ad927877bad0d10a626c377fe9d18e8773cfb21e3954a88dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "362"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d308c22a4b58afe295241cfd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "围着高台热烈旋转……\\n真是赌命的地方啊……\\n哼……我不讨厌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f6c5bd480662aa3b67efc505c14505e66c66a87d7ccd46901c202d958e75625",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "363"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f262fd4087383905bbe39e4b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "‘T-DK’……\\n嗯嘛嘛嘛嘛\\nNMA NMA MA……『收到了』？",
      "source_fingerprint": "61007aab265b610bea42d1c3a5f4a6dc80852fbc5988825d3a0716fabcb86a0b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "364"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f77f0421082a5a820bdb310c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Bang!Bang!Burning♪\\n酷炫又火热的演出\\n点燃你的心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "269246dc29caf043ba3c249b2ac1f3ead2afd0b9f4d1f477c313bf229be7164f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "365"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:537383770e935666047e7fef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是这个！去卡拉 OK 的时候，\\n最后大家都会一起唱这首歌！\\n但是……总是会哭，所以从来没有唱完整过……呜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4f75432ef09241dd488b545e6224137fcae9d4a494947b1a396ad6d86976cbd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "366"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6190a71d8591007431de5c18",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊，原来是这首……\\n姐姐在听的歌。真是的，\\n笑得那么傻兮兮的……在干嘛啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0adb1054482da6aaa849b8d2919291183f089ccd29ed2f02996eb77f23000c89",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "367"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2000df7779fdf408d3c1cce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虎视眈眈地反击大逆转……\\n局势越不利，\\n翻盘后的胜利才越大！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5dbc049e4640433697559412e4475987f98a8169c57cb702c8e9b1ccda44c23",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "368"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0a32a135e0eb2efd67a37b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵，这让我感到很受鼓舞呢。\\n作为一名以“梦的终点”为目标的旅人来说……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae8f23bf07618ba850ad8547badce5967bbfea104e3ab7d036a6772c5d0cf635",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "369"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3acecf8712d07d1e02e33771",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将绝不退让的意志\\n转化为奔跑的动力……\\n对我而言这就是这首歌的意义。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8365ab9d667b185632e6f6a083de96f49cca44cc23879140114f17e86cf94f8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "37"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baef1ebd3134707c4d2b7407",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "潘多拉说要拿我的舞蹈动作\\n当范例！这可是……\\n责任重大，不能松懈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "542ad71a7c5620651759a0d9440ffd544038e8263992c469c15d90b8cb33e57d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "370"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1e43697e8f38145d1ec7dc6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，不错。要不要也导入进\\n我的随身听……嗯？已经有了……\\n呵，是姐姐放的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3a6d2e5cdaef7b3f25bd78639d24ec8f9212bbf9f5a5e932701c551e89281de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "371"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbac656f23d9e7dd7fc4817f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "和天狼星前辈、高峰前辈她们\\n一起唱歌时，以后能够一起创造传奇吧！\\n有这样的感觉～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d01ef77cc9d323071ec5edfe688cea05147dea324585598d28b401f3b4706a1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "372"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac6bba0ee9531cc86d834d14",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "历史会改变。\\n所以需要见证者，对吧。\\n所以——别把视线从我身上移开哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2ea8e87fd60bfc0b973e1e99ef597e8979b7272ccccbc5ae65bd5160be05b4d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "373"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:574f74ab675225bd0e769841",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这种热情……好久没有了。\\n果然是被这首歌点燃了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dde70a79268ca3f806b701b74ed70890e7b81e9561c7e7ec068987926dc645e3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "374"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:828a7e7150ac7ba8cf65db79",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "所谓传说……是讲述伟业，\\n流传后世，成为梦想。\\n所以，这首歌终将如此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e80739b725bf5fbfee73f2d62d50e9bfc8176ac6c984160202544b208f4dd25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "375"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a100bd883b34dd263d241f62",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有时要稳重，有时要大胆。\\n这才是传说——\\n运气与坚韧的积累。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eced0ec46b6e8162e2e2e64f7d0ac38d899d21c84079ee625f2f4e7d0ffa85b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "376"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa4486fee5e023ba9e6121ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "让人心灵震撼的歌——\\n梦想的延续、未来的彼方。\\n画面浮现在眼前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec972922b15e17a43d4207730bb9e3a81f0c43c13c93eaf46d47443b3394b307",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "377"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b021bc0206d7b4f034d9f37",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这份疾驰感和我的冲刺如出一辙。\\n一瞬的灵光，连剑芒都无法捕捉，\\n今后也会让你看到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdc58d090ab031af19abde9d5a6fc05f2ad5838640d0d45a54a133dbd6a5e7b1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "378"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc6afa096f14427a162a130d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "歌词真的很有共鸣。\\n未来果然是要自己开拓的……\\n所以我要第一个冲向它！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28487a8325790b931e3747ef93eca8e11ad58ad83006e854a4c08fc4ee9ef991",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "379"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf7eea94e2b919637d6f793e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的是……！\\n拿黄金船一点办法都没有！\\n虽然很感激她照看我练习……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba7e1f046fd43cef57ddf99691724eb3c1cd1716b931086190b4782c2c5a67fe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "38"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:836fc44165bb357242440bda",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "戴上皇冠，\\n优雅地站在C位。\\n承载着母亲的心意与自豪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45e5fd95eb582a55571b779e305e3955a9de2ce16fbda97461df3dac72a5141f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "380"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d44711f8b3c1503ddf0ce290",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "耀眼的黄金遮住了视线……\\n等看到彼岸的景色时。\\n我要尽情高歌这首歌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b99a5b1a4920262e01dc4fc7cfaccc887a68a5bd0f97869a37436af3fae528b9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "381"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff0819875b08cd6aef447830",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即使在中央舞台，\\n我也会高歌一曲。\\n突破强敌与极限，站在最中央！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0276b6eca7e3252b3e4a17dede9971074085e12425d9e342bc425b3d91cb066",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "382"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d01c9c78bf466764d2e4572",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只会憧憬的日子结束了。\\n今后可以全力奔跑在赛道上！\\n轮到我唱歌了——！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60cb8f3852feffdd233b1b00180d56f8367ae9d954effd3674b392d126fd43ee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "383"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6557b6444f409048d4f91172",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这是属于我的凯歌。\\n端坐聆听吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "790d4c13ccf9818edcc4df6b181a246ba0cd6760c9d0001eed5a4752ef5c62f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "384"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24f383f4f09135b3d9d0dd7f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我喜欢音乐哦！不论抒情还是\\n快节奏，我的准则就是\\n一边跳舞一边听！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c57c7423525ee446f14b01d3d5319ba1ca83b45ca54c3701b3848a41436bd16",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "385"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05db709185963c562b2deb77",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哟，还真收集了不少乐曲！\\n来，把我的扇子借给你，\\n陪我一起跳舞吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e67f5fb559ca6b0477c0b6b9b1e263d29b801ec76a10363832b17c37371da27c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "386"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e87b9d0ada3b428da23ea5a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好像各种类型的歌都有呢！\\n……会不会也有交通安全\\n宣传歌之类的？",
      "source_fingerprint": "05708b097463708e57f61238aa616a2a31f216fbf6dd7cd044d1843edb23559d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "387"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba7fc1c118a3b83e825d1e9a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "来打个赌吧。这首歌能不能\\n让观众陶醉。如果我输了……\\n这顶帽子就是你的了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2980c3e1be08c46c8feba0168c413699cb04957a16be02693721d133aacbe27a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "388"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd9654164ba84524c9764c24",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在房间里听这首歌时，荒漠印象说\\n好像想要针织帽……\\n下次要一起去买同款。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1128baaa9caea62584ca8d2ca7f31bc49141e739c645275024d8afe50e2a62f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "389"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09c370071d034ec42c880f80",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不管哪一首都是毫不逊色的名曲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "753e70c7d8aa761c482f07da40feeba00ea7080c53b7712aa500331bcb13f559",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "39"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57541cc5930c98ea080123d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论是披发还是盘发。\\n光是戴法不同，帽子\\n就能带来不一样的心情呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d389d46b36952e80997adc97bcc48248d281e276c303912684b808fbedc2007a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "390"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95aa623d56fd615e0b90c669",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "把帽子深深戴上，\\n或许能变成另一个自己……\\n这首歌就让人有这种感觉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f260b3b0310083524b1eb51ffe4ede4dad3843ee5ce76c8caf352f118e8a3d8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "391"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:673bcb1e8387b00f2521b408",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "BoC'z We/n♪\\n和姐姐们去K歌\\n也会唱这首哦！超带气氛☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "da0379963d927859fceb0a75686bc480a46576e3e2ee3d1ef30a0f1174c3a0a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "392"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0ec451b2f219c74803c0d8b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "热烈又甜蜜地融合……\\n做大福时\\n大概也是这种感觉吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c293ee1c011efc4d8222bf2a2b4edc855b7fb49992db5709b9ace9c093cdc548",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "393"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ebedd1e44b1412f54c086ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不要走，啊。听到这样反而\\n会很想走，但换成反过来，\\n是不是就会追上去了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "13eaf70a161c7907130db325e5635bdadfb03a3de4c0eac44984dc6a4011aef2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "394"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ad095830f3770cd1c45c5f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "手滑把芝麻豆腐扔出去，\\n天使就掉下来啦……\\n还好直接落嘴里了，算安全吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e6797e6b089adde49c3482f7f17d6ccc7d9f17b268218f9f63020251e546bae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "395"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95a64b24ca2c18ca71b91321",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即使是单色的世界，\\n最闪耀的……\\n是谁呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d41c46b3361ca5b23924061d83de4da7d6e60a7de4a946e9c3d984c2ee18dd74",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "396"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19df762754d440c8bd839ca8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从曲风中能感受到\\n诉说的情感。这歌词\\n也让人想细细品味。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15706ca0246fc7c88d8ec873278a49c0055e9c276edbd2fc45d4e41c61003ab5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "397"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77990af8e3289c0d2f8ee75a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "消逝的回忆确实存在。\\n但无论多么短暂，\\n都不会变成没有发生过的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8366af7aa946e15b89058e8000f124af5f037f1143edcf6ce6af6af861cd3294",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "398"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66c512570b9ada7965e07a36",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "memoire……是记忆的意思吧？\\n如果要留下记忆，\\n当然要尽量都是快乐的才好呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4c4f7dedae15617babf80dab9684aafc055b6e817940d28834ec334e0f99c25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "399"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:947bc11ec827cdf0fb122cfb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊，这首歌……如果我说它不太好唱\\n让人很伤脑筋的话\\n气槽会陪我上课吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a74cc6e9cf6b28120c77fec3a4c8a32b87ba2c3a0693cc98735bd77771001d77",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65750933ab1e8b405ed897ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本能与本能彼此冲击的\\n大乱斗即将开、幕～！\\n就让神鹰来敲响擂台的钟声吧～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b90c5ffc7d4d1253712feca5849937e5b4db9320ab404a014d25ade09924528",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "40"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97ef43c159b6c870766a64f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这首歌真有速度感，\\n太棒了！从头到尾，\\n都让人停不下来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "293d465b52aece5b516936b598d52cbb33121e294a90b37dc8b828d9226cd362",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "400"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72131bce6725bc07f35ad41c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当快坚持不下、脚步要停时，\\n只要听到这首歌，\\n就仿佛又能继续奔跑了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce3ce3ed5ac4be9c7233ad87472168f15164b3bf86942c1ba77f8bc333b908bb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "401"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56cb128c66b38a5eb7591eaa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "小时候，父亲送我的帽子\\n成了我的宝物。每次听到这首歌，\\n总会让我想起那些回忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1be1d364bb6e6c7e33fe82de438abcb691e0da31b1af61c84d16f8aa43071dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "402"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a0c3e6bc34c6023152be7b2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "戏剧性的曲风让人心动。\\n我也想要登上更高的地方，\\n想要闪耀——",
      "source_fingerprint": "20079ae76be33896b4cbb07328108f311d4512a3b8fcab4225902e45acaa4bfe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "403"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:725f45f9edfba24717c543a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有收录情歌吗？\\n要是找到了，\\n一起合唱吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c716e41d233b79a3eee5d465f33ab4f2939e752ca718a9c543177bd441f51f6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "404"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0088737291cc09e468079a43",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这首歌，是“爱”哦。\\n对帽子的“爱”，对伙伴的“爱”。\\n唱出来，一定会更紧密相连。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd09fcb494f01df411215db967b91107dcadfeb638b18e39cc09f78cff98eba7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "405"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3ebe4f65541371c36f6cea4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "歌词里读得出的时代背景、\\n曲风反映的时代潮流……\\n总会不自觉被这些吸引……",
      "source_fingerprint": "937eeef91159e57d66efebe4711c342acb4b1f0c7d2f9bd54846055ffebfea2c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "406"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddb273fd323bf281ce3f4046",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你在KTV的必点曲目是～？\\n……啊。可能太老了我不认识，\\n但我马上就能记住的！因为我是天才嘛♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8fed4fd540f77273ef95aff91a2ca29c3bf3f8422e6b99efe65288a38c7e007",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "407"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9af262fe94d71ac56c531289",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "音乐能让人平静下来呢。\\n甚至能平息潜藏在心底的，暗影……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbbd125f59e7d653cca69c20a8b3b8c8e84da9ca5cd693ae50977fad419b9ba3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "408"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9fb01ab309eddf3625c0543",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "鸣响的是胜者的旋律。\\n待到老夫夺得天下之时，\\n定要让这旋律传遍世间！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6521c6bbf26be5319fcc81c035a012f52901c2af791aad4c9443c57422916e2f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "409"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5672a9ac9332b63b0ab07cde",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔，传奇……\\n也就是小神鹰传说对吧！\\n春、夏、秋、冬、神鹰我最强～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd9d917ef3f07801e18c360e187ab13e43bf86182ca4669a11082114735bdd58",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "41"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c410ca18fc4389c7aa12002",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正义，就是不断前进的意志！\\n本官向上攀登的这个顶点，\\n正是作为模范觉悟的证明！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd136e093378f6ce994f985173755c7a3409e40f8b7661435bb04d833913d8f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "410"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41706e2a76be931bd3da1275",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最快的我，将超越一切。\\n……听了这首歌就能传达出去了吧，\\n英里是最强的！是最棒的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94f526b8c5a62d4c54e1d4c9d13a733bb30599c528447d42f76d5c3ca3a98e01",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "411"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9eefb30cfcc86fa7ee7e723",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "华丽地、高傲地，以女王之姿。\\n为了终有一日能展现的那一天，\\n我会磨砺自己，为荣光之刻做准备的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbc7aaedb144c8bec324a4156be4e310937e75bff2ea858bbab1ef6d24f3480c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "412"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aa4979cda5c8a20b5bdd454",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你不觉得这是一首充满“爱”的曲子吗？\\n我想用这首曲子，\\n给社群成员的成员们回馈满满的心动♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd975971625cbb4ae1e6443f1bf926e62a9f297d25d6909a30366b84c010bf4e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "413"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12b0d14dc8f8a50bc3cdc24a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这旋律所诉说的，是荣光的记录。\\n无论跨越多少星霜岁月，胜者的名字\\n都将伴随着歌曲被传颂下去吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b06bf9e2760810986d63c0f8d0ea7733b7127bc640759a7f66b18aaf236a5141",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "414"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cee3a180fe61108c84bf6768",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只要交给天才潘多拉酱，\\n就算是GⅠ赛也是小菜一碟啦！\\n我会让你心动不已的，敬请期待吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a442f8fb7a11c127c46fa77dd3113fb55cd02d823429a3e49b710eff4ad087b9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "415"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8409a24fed9af12a2eb88ee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想要为了那位而盛放。\\n……这种说出来会显得狂妄的\\n愿望，如果是寄托在这首歌里的话……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f42b406186fc6dc1e8ffc88fb7fc7d8e3f99338c2bbc7e5cf2043d6917ff5911",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "416"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54252de8f8546e6cb4ff1e16",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在打工的地方搬运重物时，\\n只要唱起这首歌就会涌出力量！\\n呵呵，还在周围流行起来了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3acf3eff89393652dab56b4f8eef7c11f90b9fb088aadbb22e721c706e296589",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "417"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0ddc4f15f02d91f4fbd155d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这歌词意外地很深刻呢。\\n像是保持本真才是最棒的、之类的。\\n……应该有不少人会被触动吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0b07cc378a38d285fd3d142daf9d067735f942c9603bcfb70ef2356d292c1e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "418"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26154e1cb531e96db8d3df16",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "磨磨蹭蹭地汗流浃背，什么的！\\n这还真是被将了一军啊！\\n拿去吧，给你一张坐垫～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e87f78f06d16c240dfd34674b5e8c1585ebb73859ab43f91f59b855f9d027e53",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "419"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e5c37177fd95cc7f2e5202f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "音乐、鉴赏、大欢唱！\\n与神鹰我一起嗨起来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db704d39ffd5e02e95ca09f42b26e51c4f3963aff67f1f8cc518a4e7faba6da3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "42"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9532afd8b6229a55c756634f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要是用这首歌把全身锻炼得肌肉紧实，\\n说不定就能和丸善小姐抗衡了！？\\n麻烦再播放一遍！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa73934b58b8b907045b3197dad66e13f9626a8f32d12ee46d4bb999250aa68d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "420"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:469a53e82d69ac7d315f7697",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "来，训练员也一起来吧！\\n速度！力量！耐力！！\\n我们要把每个角落都锻炼到哦！来吧，来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92109486146860a62dc7c539123d2d364ac6fcc9df3aba88b09844b0dac48c50",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "421"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a608b4d469dc7c71c1f6684",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这是推荐给潘多拉小姐的曲子！\\n她超级喜欢……\\n我们有时还会一起唱呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "974101f436e00e2c4721b037373bcbc575e51107c2408542b69e65dde008316d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "422"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:931f96b740f44c8aa82cddf8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唱了这首歌的话，看世界的方式\\n就会改变的哦☆感觉视野变宽广了～？\\n嗯～我也去问问小杏吧♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc6320eedf5e843c663d49e435729cb225d19313ada6b802291ee2c3a74461a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "423"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c855f1870f84ecd8115d59cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喜欢吗？\\n觉得怎么样？看着机伶的眼睛\\n把你所想的直接说出来嘛☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "349e964154be4cbccd04ee1334c305040765b9ce439711573e4a811dffb6fd19",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "424"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a01bcb77c6b608a09fdb40f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊啊……如此耀眼的曲子……。\\n发自内心地，\\n甚至让人感到焦急的程度……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3269d4dd5b98c1c47496c206a4471fd96f3c20cd7d6d1d98353077dd6be7b77",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "425"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1857578cd4e28c5fdc72a628",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "和勇心酱一起想了姿势哦♡\\n全方位无死角可爱简直太无敌啦～♡\\n所·以……live也要来看看哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb06c17d6f3955682cfcfdc74129d2eb20f68950372a54ff67ca981dae913aa4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "426"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24facedc37207eb48de3c381",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在直播里唱这首歌的时候，大家都会发\\n特定的弹幕哦！你也\\n来“啾啾♡”地试一下吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d66a1e6676c22a2eea8ee3bb20869082c04e2794a15186642adbd44296b5d3c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "427"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37181d749674d03cddc586a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "收到了高尚小姐写满听后感\\n的信……！里面写了好多好多\\n夸奖的话……真是感慨万千！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15d3d3b6ec5f1307fb0787e7f281b56b7ec1398759d6f8388b01496ca0a52380",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "428"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3741f54c3086c6dc0746fb8e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "“打倒，不可能”！\\n……真是句绝佳的话语呢。\\n总有一天我会将其体现出来的，绝对！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ace9268c44bda49926829a21e9562518104ff826e2780f0bc139e123b7ce227",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "429"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8448a28ed1f65c7b0e72c92",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我虽走在充满苦难的这条路上！\\n但王座已注定为我所属！\\n天啊！这股强悍与美丽真是重罪！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9194330925d4ef92c8602143ff6f2da193657acec029d98baef6dbd640eabc60",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "43"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f4a36a20d199b665d28cc87",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这首曲子，在KTV唱的时候可是会引起\\n抢麦克风的战争的……嘛，\\n只要我咳两声就能镇住场子就是了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b498dc302a4889807dc44533ec81a220b3f765d75a7a9ddf6e81ae533d9b6fc5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "430"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d518f98ec297ffe8cee29dd8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听着这首曲子，我就会想起来。\\n那个耀眼、清澈……令人心情愉悦的。\\n那样的……某一天的早晨。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6506dd85ae903a5b05db34c036fd4a0a9be4b5a21b4f5c00b55039f477db9645",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "431"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
